  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To prevent and address the immediate localised drivers of radicalisation leading to violent extremism in target communities in Benin, C&#xf4;te d&#x2019;Ivoire, Ghana and Togo. Providing support to strengthening the &#x2018;Infrastructures for Peace&#x2019;, namely mechanisms for early warning, and early response at local level and socio-economic resilience of at-risk youth and women and other vulnerable populations.</narrative>
  </description>
